1
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:53,987
If you ever see him using it in the household, it means he intends to do harm.

2
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:57,132
You must be very careful...

3
00:00:59,030 --> 00:01:01,163
and don't trust Khun Chai Phakdee.

4
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:18,800
Father, please have some water first.

5
00:01:22,910 --> 00:01:24,252
What are you doing?

6
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:25,926
I know everything now.

7
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:29,741
What nonsense are you talking about?

8
00:01:30,630 --> 00:01:31,261
Stop!

9
00:01:34,220 --> 00:01:35,384
What are you doing?

10
00:01:36,780 --> 00:01:39,064
You're poisoning my father's drink!

11
00:01:45,060 --> 00:01:46,670
You're imagining things, Rinkham.

12
00:01:47,050 --> 00:01:48,350
Then what's this?

13
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:51,304
Do you think I'm a fool?

14
00:01:59,020 --> 00:02:00,190
Since you already know,

15
00:02:01,340 --> 00:02:02,972
I suppose I can stop pretending.

16
00:02:05,563 --> 00:02:07,560
I will be the ruler of this city.

17
00:02:08,940 --> 00:02:12,387
As the governor's son-in-law,

18
00:02:13,753 --> 00:02:15,750
it's only fitting that I take my rightful place.

19
00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:21,815
You're going to kill my father!

20
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:23,501
Rinkham...

21
00:02:25,250 --> 00:02:27,132
"kill" is such a harsh word.

22
00:02:28,370 --> 00:02:30,960
Let's just say I'm making your father weaker...

23
00:02:37,033 --> 00:02:38,461
little by little.

24
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:46,664
But now that you know the truth,

25
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,880
I can't let you live.

26
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:25,396
Kaew, where did you go last night?

27
00:03:26,340 --> 00:03:27,495
I discovered something.

28
00:03:30,700 --> 00:03:33,778
Something that could put Rinkham in grave danger.

29
00:03:34,990 --> 00:03:36,012
What do you mean?

30
00:03:39,370 --> 00:03:40,664
Khun Chai Phakdee...

31
00:03:42,180 --> 00:03:43,889
he may not be the man we thought he was.

32
00:03:44,860 --> 00:03:47,735
So, did you go to see him last night?

33
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,618
No.

34
00:03:50,890 --> 00:03:52,116
I went to see Rinkham.

35
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:55,058
How is she?

36
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:57,532
She's safe.

37
00:03:59,250 --> 00:04:03,563
But I don't know how much longer she'll stay that way.

38
00:04:06,390 --> 00:04:08,215
I'll bring the medicine to my father first,

39
00:04:09,212 --> 00:04:10,676
then I'll go back to her.

40
00:04:11,130 --> 00:04:12,184
You're going back again?

41
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,658
I have a bad feeling...

42
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:19,070
as if something terrible is about to happen.

43
00:04:21,140 --> 00:04:27,243
I believe Khun Chai Phakdee is planning something.

44
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:30,990
What are you going to do?

45
00:04:33,620 --> 00:04:34,818
I'm going to see her.

46
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:40,836
I'm not going to let her face this alone ever again.

47
00:04:42,732 --> 00:04:43,803
Then I'm coming with you.

48
00:04:52,180 --> 00:04:53,790
Is it really that dangerous?

49
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:59,083
I don't know just how dangerous it will be.

50
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:07,070
All I know is that I'll protect the woman I love, no matter what it takes.

51
00:05:09,660 --> 00:05:11,852
Then let's go.

52
00:05:28,950 --> 00:05:30,258
What are you doing here?

53
00:05:31,150 --> 00:05:33,249
You were ordered to leave the city.

54
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:36,400
But it seems you have no intention of going.

55
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:40,867
So we're here to make sure you do.

56
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:43,550
You have no right!

57
00:05:45,010 --> 00:05:46,160
Don't hurt my friend!

58
00:05:46,650 --> 00:05:48,264
These are Khun Chai Phakdee's orders.

59
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,258
Eliminate them.

60
00:05:52,650 --> 00:05:53,932
If you want to try, then come to me.

61
00:05:53,963 --> 00:05:54,603
Die!!

62
00:06:07,820 --> 00:06:08,418
Hey!

63
00:06:12,750 --> 00:06:13,218
Stop!

64
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:15,206
Or he'll die!

65
00:06:17,710 --> 00:06:18,800
Thought you were so tough, didn't you?

66
00:06:19,420 --> 00:06:20,596
In the end, you still have to surrender.

67
00:06:24,950 --> 00:06:25,766
On your knees!

68
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:51,907
Please... don't hurt him.

69
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,033
Let him go.

70
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,470
I'll do whatever you want.

71
00:06:56,460 --> 00:06:57,907
Surrendering isn't enough.

72
00:06:58,780 --> 00:07:02,769
We're going to wipe your entire family off the face of the earth.

73
00:07:07,310 --> 00:07:09,095
Those are Khun Chai Phakdee's orders.

74
00:07:12,978 --> 00:07:13,556
Kaew,

75
00:07:15,220 --> 00:07:16,455
don't worry about me.

76
00:07:27,050 --> 00:07:27,858
Don't do it!

77
00:07:33,070 --> 00:07:33,858
Don't do it!

78
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,258
Father!

79
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:43,649
Are you hurt anywhere?

80
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,800
No, my son. Don't worry about me.

81
00:07:48,730 --> 00:07:52,572
I should thank you for bringing me the medicine.

82
00:07:53,107 --> 00:07:55,100
Otherwise, I wouldn't even have been able to get out of bed.

83
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:03,686
I'm sorry for putting you through all of this, Father.

84
00:08:06,473 --> 00:08:08,470
You don't need to apologize to me.

85
00:08:09,690 --> 00:08:14,350
Go... save the one you love.

86
00:08:18,900 --> 00:08:19,803
Then I'll stay here with him.

87
00:08:20,220 --> 00:08:21,378
No.

88
00:08:22,910 --> 00:08:25,095
I can take care of myself now.

89
00:08:25,981 --> 00:08:28,596
You both have something far more important to do.

90
00:08:29,930 --> 00:08:31,218
Go and save the one you love...

91
00:08:33,210 --> 00:08:35,070
and come back safely.

92
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:38,196
I know you can do it.
